18
00:03:28,552 --> 00:03:41,870
Verified by 183 automated checks: 124 Node suite subtests across 11 files + 59 Kernel Gates including a 12-query Python SQLite oracle.

19
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:57,747
10,000 users / 2,000 teams seeded in 13.4s; 100-client /board p95 = 36.68 ms (5.4x under 200 ms SLA). Single-writer WAL prevents split-brain.

